  "description": "On-demand connectivity diagnostics for .NET MAUI on Android and iOS. Runs DNS, gateway, TCP, TLS, HTTPS, API health, latency, and packet-timing checks so support can say \"Internet is available, but the API endpoint is unreachable\" instead of \"Something went wrong.\" Not a network monitor — NetworkMonitor watches; this plugin diagnoses.",
